      "id": "claim_d762c63b078e43589251f4936641057f",
      "statement": "For taxable years beginning on or after 2026-01-01, Revenue Procedure 2025-41 sets the AMT exemption amounts and reduces the exemption by $0.25 for every dollar of AMTI above $500,000 for an unmarried taxpayer and $1,000,000 for joint filers; those thresholds are not section 1(f)-indexed before 2030.",
